    "body": "`bip-0010.mediawiki` line 57 has a closing `</pre>` where the opening tag of the example TxDP block was meant. As a result the whole example (`-----BEGIN-TRANSACTION-3fX59xPj---…` through line 90) renders as unformatted prose on GitHub, with the leading whitespace and line structure lost. Changing it to `<pre>` balances the tags (3 open / 3 close) and restores the block.\n",
    "labels": [
